# Wave W17-I (Mt. Millstone — Lower Halls): wet mill floor — dark wet falls-hall flags, grey-blue stone gone near-black where the falls keep it soaked, a wet sheen catching along the walking line (design: falls sheeting down the rock into dark pools, slick stone paths). The Lower Halls’ own floor; the Upper Halls’ spray floor stands one value up from it.
